"Wide-character output to a byte oriented stream can be performed through the "
"B<fprintf>(3)  function with the B<%lc> and B<%ls> directives."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
